# ZyraVision Mobile — Design System

## Overview
The mobile design system mirrors the web application's look and feel, ensuring a consistent brand experience. All reusable UI components are prefixed with `Zy` and live in `lib/ui/widgets/`.

## File Locations

| Concern | Path |
|---------|------|
| Widgets | `lib/ui/widgets/` |
| Colors | `lib/core/theme/zy_colors.dart` |
| Typography | `lib/core/theme/zy_typography.dart` |
| Spacing | `lib/core/theme/zy_spacing.dart` |
| Shadows | `lib/core/theme/zy_shadows.dart` |
| Border Radius | `lib/core/theme/zy_radius.dart` |
| Theme Data | `lib/core/theme/zy_theme.dart` |

## Color Palette

All colors come from `ZyColors`. NEVER use hardcoded `Color(0xFF...)` values.

### Primary (Blue)
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| `primary50` | `#EFF6FF` | Backgrounds, hover states |
| `primary100` | `#DBEAFE` | Light backgrounds |
| `primary200` | `#BFDBFE` | Borders |
| `primary500` | `#3B82F6` | Secondary accents |
| `primary600` | `#2563EB` | **Primary brand color** |
| `primary700` | `#1D4ED8` | Pressed states |
| `primary900` | `#1E3A8A` | Dark text on light bg |

### Semantic Colors
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| `success` | `#16A34A` | Online status, confirmations |
| `warning` | `#D97706` | Warnings, degraded states |
| `danger` | `#DC2626` | Errors, delete actions, alerts |
| `info` | `#2563EB` | Informational messages |

### Neutral (Gray)
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| `gray50` | `#F9FAFB` | Page background (light) |
| `gray100` | `#F3F4F6` | Card background (light) |
| `gray200` | `#E5E7EB` | Borders, dividers |
| `gray400` | `#9CA3AF` | Placeholder text |
| `gray500` | `#6B7280` | Secondary text |
| `gray700` | `#374151` | Primary text (light mode) |
| `gray900` | `#111827` | Headings (light mode) |

### Dark Mode
- Fully supported via `ThemeData` with `ThemeMode.system` / `.dark` / `.light`.
- Dark surfaces: `gray800` (#1F2937), `gray900` (#111827).
- Text on dark: `gray100` for primary, `gray400` for secondary.
- All `ZyColors` expose both light and dark variants through the theme.

