## Core Components

### ZyButton
- **Variants**: `primary`, `secondary`, `danger`, `ghost`, `outline`
- **Sizes**: `sm` (height 32), `md` (height 40), `lg` (height 48)
- **States**: default, hover, pressed, disabled, loading
- **Loading**: Shows a circular spinner replacing the label
- **Icon**: Optional leading/trailing icon
- **Full width**: Optional `isFullWidth` flag

### ZyTextField
- Label, hint, helper text, error text
- Leading/trailing icons
- Obscure text toggle (password)
- Character counter
- Validation integration

### ZyCard
- Elevated, outlined, or filled variants
- Optional header, body, footer sections
- Pressable with `onTap`

### ZyBadge
- Status badges: online (green), offline (gray), alert (red), warning (amber)
- Dot or label style

### ZyAvatar
- Image, initials, or icon fallback
- Sizes: sm (32), md (40), lg (56)
- Online status indicator dot

### ZyAppBar
- Back navigation, title, actions
- Transparent variant for streaming pages

### ZyBottomSheet
- Handle bar, title, scrollable content
- Modal and persistent modes

### ZyDialog
- Title, content, actions
- Confirm/cancel pattern
- Destructive variant (danger-styled confirm)

### ZyEmptyState
- Icon, title, description, action button
- Used when lists are empty

### ZyLoadingIndicator
- Spinner, skeleton, shimmer variants
- Full-screen and inline modes

### ZyStatusIndicator
- Camera status: online, offline, recording, error
- Connection quality: excellent, good, fair, poor

## Responsive Design

### Breakpoints
| Device | Width | Columns |
|--------|-------|---------|
| Phone (small) | < 360dp | 4 |
| Phone (standard) | 360-599dp | 4 |
| Tablet | >= 600dp | 8 |
| Tablet (large) | >= 840dp | 12 |

### Layout Rules
- Use `LayoutBuilder` or `MediaQuery` to adapt layouts.
- Camera grid: 1 column (phone), 2 columns (tablet portrait), 3 columns (tablet landscape).
- Navigation: Bottom bar (phone), side rail or drawer (tablet).
- Use `SafeArea` on all pages.

## Accessibility

### Required Standards
- **Contrast**: Minimum 4.5:1 for text, 3:1 for large text and icons.
- **Semantic Labels**: Every interactive widget must have a `Semantics` label or `tooltip`.
- **Focus Traversal**: Logical tab order on all forms and interactive areas.
- **Touch Targets**: Minimum 48x48dp for all tappable elements.
- **Screen Reader**: Test with TalkBack (Android) and VoiceOver (iOS).
- **Text Scaling**: Support up to 200% system font scaling.
- **Reduce Motion**: Respect `MediaQuery.disableAnimations`.

## Rules

- NEVER use hardcoded colors — always reference `ZyColors` tokens.
- NEVER use hardcoded spacing — always reference `ZySpacing` constants.
- NEVER use hardcoded font sizes — always reference `ZyTypography` styles.
- NEVER use hardcoded border radius — always reference `ZyRadius`.
- ALWAYS support dark mode on every widget.
- ALWAYS provide semantic labels for interactive elements.
- ALWAYS test on both phone and tablet form factors.
- ALWAYS use the `Zy` prefix for reusable design system widgets.
